# ============================================================
# .gitattributes: which files are written and which are output.
#
# GitHub counts every committed byte when it draws the language
# bar, and this repository commits its build output on purpose:
# the site deploys by uploading `aab/`, with no build step in CI,
# so a generated page has to be in git to be on the site. See
# CLAUDE.md. The result is a bar that reads 61% HTML, 33%
# JavaScript, and it is measuring the compiler's output rather
# than anything anybody wrote.
#
# The entries below say which files are generated and which are
# kept for reference. That is what the attributes are for, and it
# is true of every path listed: each one has a source elsewhere in
# this repository and a command in CLAUDE.md that rebuilds it.
#
# It changes what the bar reports. It does not change what the
# repository is, and no line here is a substitute for the
# transition itself: TRANSITION.md Stage 11 deletes the 251
# generated HTML pages by moving what is in them into a database
# and a React route, and that is the change that actually moves
# the number.
#
# `linguist-generated` also collapses these files in a diff, which
# is right for all of them: reviewing a 228 KB bundle is not
# reviewing anything. Read the source and the build command.
# ============================================================

# ---------- the React build ----------
# Vite's output, from app/src/**. `npm run build` in app/.
# There were two until the desk retired to archive/desk-react/ on
# 21 August 2026 and /desk/app.js left aab/ with it.
aab/studio/app.js     linguist-generated=true

# ---------- the four schools ----------
# One file each, and it is the LADDER: node scripts/build-modules.ts
# writes these four from shared/curricula/*.ts.
#
# It was the whole of each directory, with a comment about 251
# pages written by a builder in it. There are no pages there and
# there are no builders: Stage 11.7 made all 251 routes and the
# builders are in archive/schools-builders/. What is left beside
# these four is hand-written source, progress.js and hub.js and
# each school's icons.js, and marking those generated collapsed
# them in every diff, so a change to one showed as nothing.
#
# aab/learn/** was here too and reached nothing: the money school
# moved to /money/ on 17 August 2026.
aab/deutsch/curriculum.js   linguist-generated=true
aab/english/curriculum.js   linguist-generated=true
aab/money/curriculum.js     linguist-generated=true
aab/quran/curriculum.js     linguist-generated=true

# ---------- the feed, the sitemap, the robots file ----------
# node scripts/build-meta.ts
aab/feed.xml          linguist-generated=true
aab/sitemap.xml       linguist-generated=true
aab/robots.txt        linguist-generated=true
aab/sw-manifest.json  linguist-generated=true

# ---------- the share cards ----------
# node scripts/build-og.ts
aab/og/**             linguist-generated=true

# ---------- the nightly backup ----------
# .github/workflows/backup.yml writes this, nobody edits it.
content/articles.backup.json linguist-generated=true

# ---------- what the site used to be ----------
# Not deployed and not imported. See archive/README.md.
archive/**            linguist-vendored=true
